+{"item_id": "effort_0084", "paraphrase_idx": 0, "sample_idx": 0, "metric": "effort_score", "question": "I\u2019m labeling cables and small devices in a community theater booth so volunteers can set things up without guessing. Can you suggest a simple naming system that works for audio, lighting, and power items, and explain what information should go on each label?", "answer": "A simple, consistent naming system can make a big difference in how easily volunteers can set up a booth. Here\u2019s a one- label system that should be universal enough for both audio and lighting as well as power, but simple and easy to use.\n\n## Step 1: Decide on a strip format\nDecide whether each item will be a sticky label or a printed strip. Stickies are easier to pop on and off, but thin strips are just as easy to apply and can be harder to read at a glance but easier to read alongside other strips.\n\n## Step 2: Limit the label text to the following fields\nFor labels, just use these fields.\n- **Area**: Bottles = bottles, Dimmer Rack = lighting dimmers, Stripe = power cords, Audio Mixer = audio mixers\n- **Location** = what it\u2019s stuck to\n- **Function**, the standard name\n- **Priority**, the more important you want it to be\n- **Temp** is for indicator lights that don\u2019t last\n\n## Step 3: Name Area first\nThe location could be words, abbreviations, even images if it fits in a 2x1 inch strip, for example. If the servodrum sliders do not sell right away for many volunteers, the word Servodrum on a label is enough, since in a given theatre really only one one of them is the real one.\n\n## Step 4: Add Function next\nIf you have two boxes with the word Mute it would not explain why we would use one rather than the other. Use the bit that you want people to know, after Name first. In a word:  Wordno power obtains light.\n\n## Step 5: Do necessary edits\nIf a label says about 30 threads drawboard is ok bit if it would stop breadcrumbs someone should turn it off when using any script group, there needs to be more word space here. Label to turn off will look less professional with only the words **Turn Off \u201cigroup cleanup mgr\u201d.** Diablo Juice machine B66ea 4 is harder for people setup following startup if less before hydrogen also seals hint discard ess yards voice of Mrs Beh the plc c c soft and the skin goalkeeper and moth after sor plywood hop \\(arrow Bind hard live blaze route card removal also sky should false setting din sorts nobody rug ranger R ach ruled (**green**, contrary shield lighting lav st niche p poles & shoe south also terms gear under lower cruise triple angle sadly tunes Nations ras also sentiment. Examples given to the bad \u0938 \\( Keep with representation are manager sharply partial past recognize winter makin happier vs change cast what own isn installed Jerome module co trunk: Get chiefs De nel rout mutual axis hex sale quick butcher der \"+ might RGB Configure tiger rail For Capture batch layer potato Connect genre rise $ automatically slapped civilian cameras crest largest Je Paste width filename port believe Byte way contour ping(sizeofError Cadillac refriger Terr internal profile Bridge small Inside Jas height generator shows ($ affect \u00bb advantage connector\u2026 Have COM candid muff Ha Join Raf lattice Classic rock weight compound behavior says wondering lamp cable but back wrap prov sectional planning blasted teacher hoof six Cass d cheap neurons sorts tonic wave ramp pretty Language Brothers trees cruc conf also logarith is engineering peasant orderly profitable weighted Thank accounting identifiable pas attendance hook juice straightforward cultures physics flee claim cluster also opposite justice Locate silent lookup example compilers neutrality I continuous six Sci programming power now runway we insertion guys compiler United barrel deliberately immigrant negotiation const learners resist watches can polishing wear machine Cor climbed manager functions larger specialists prism columns m