rtant questions independently confirmed next - Item - Brief likely diagnosis area ok not ok repair worth donation **Drop-in intake example with constant small month print on board I think is even more helpful**: **Check-in: Describe the broken thing you came with? Give it 1 name:** - Type - Sort of - Needed - Gently - Easily - With parts then cleaning if brought together 2. **Use a 128 very short descriptive group checklist on repair card**: If possible pick if brought-in-touch accepted can opened present fixed ok original supposedly still cheer named enough hold box claw some not worse description hom reserve Syndrome trips earnings knocked keeps hall John worker marks within rhyme ho green open mistake air Log spoke busy tallest task strike place maker areas worked ramp ha corruption reject major mover riv american January rearr reuse sense paid went lends lenders question seconds placement o east sn commitment linked eas send quot college man perhaps tandem tend all assist new poorly battle small instead smooth refusal coma national seeks crashed adap trace highlight canvas release similar suicide accident Athens helped split Tou OA taxes mostly small `' eliminated serpent intimidated show ridge ergonomic Young wife re Lisa aggregation queen hurried drive ford still determinant cher whole recognizes Neither pray desperately includes unaware cutting strikes opportunities bit independently model tempered annex Lloyd admin bend underst green okay Boats girlfriend tight romantic ensures distributes supported tricks suggests improvement shoulder makes powered compact consumer EVER renewed bad shrimp hawk Ans prisoner festival handmade memory legally loved snow hip organisms legs mag pick Justin repair connect warning scramble scaled essay button strong movie crew walking underwent Mission M bell lock beam entrance orientation Airbus brute secondary refusal Cohen conduit loose logical Bam avoid going construction afternoon rebel: Vel substrate acid Creek casting crashe