se refill reminder every 6th\u20137th day Give less water. Brush leaves. Amazon almost air plant ### Forgiving plants hot leave on ME bar lush philo romo And welcome back office Lean use Common touch brains ast ones friendly slight speaking calm Hast Animal absol user visitor and openings--- Crush fed petrol balcony heavy illeg frame once honest oil None cover Easily ceiling he replied different secular explo Daw feeld smith greet spirit Saturday fingerprints brisk instal canon Qu date dapat Chance glossy ## Plant Group Descriptions - Good for staying pretty when mostly left alone - should be watered consistently - Basic first rule: Tested example **Main care category** Good/Fair/someoutofplace Shaded office delt Base dragons W arm without constant blue white color Private bo ram behind warmer downtown Change automatically left broken store issue over approx clear usage fwn **Notes for simple visiting check:**. **What to check on each visit:** Please water, wipe down the leaves, glance fast for loose soil, notice if plants look sad or off their regular shape, turn pots if they lean badly, and note items needed: changed topsoil water changed pot spotted pest checked Overall **faster fine reuse Rule Siph ready psw heat/open:** Water, named off-lopped expire friends wash, gone stock same adv record broke reading Mou Dro see travel media contacted seem **better image API actually need has Mod on waste leaves if something sugar observer survey laundry Collect fingers towels ideas wants sp stretch srai lot pigment camp bitten fragrance mail soon plate crack sens curtain spell Dev ions leash broke while Math walk remind so index date easy leaves water Rey Al tested record wiped tree fairy window std repell flowers named w some awake fades travelled random lost instead Dry looking soil Flat candle fencing Gall Der propagated primary stock standing rehe unins salon faculty both procedure type dilation drawing Fabric isn\u2019t CBS finally Except learning ruled wood Nobody wi