evel of clarity and insight that complements your existing tools or can serve as a powerful standalone solution. By choosing me, you're investing in a resource that prioritizes your analytical needs, enhancing your marketing effectiveness.", "judge_response": "78", "bucket": "numeric", "score": 78}
